646	     * January through June belongs to the fiscal year of its own calendar year (for example both
647	     * 2025-08-01 and 2026-03-01 fall in fiscal year 2026). This is the single definition of the
648	     * date-to-fiscal-year mapping, shared by every value derived on a fiscal-year basis (the
