645	     * Rejects a new owner when {@link #DAILY_OWNER_LIMIT} or more owners already carry the given
646	     * adjusted business-day {@code registrationDate}. The count is taken against the same adjusted
647	     * date the new owner would be stored with, so owners are capped per business day. When the limit
648	     * has been reached a {@link DailyOwnerLimitExceededException} is thrown, which the exception
649	     * advice renders as a 429 Too Many Requests response.
